### IAM Binding pattern
```hcl
variable "iam_bindings" {
  type = map(object({
    role    = string
    members = list(string)
  }))
  default = {}
}

resource "google_storage_bucket_iam_binding" "default" {
  for_each = var.iam_bindings
  bucket   = google_storage_bucket.default.name
  role     = each.value.role
  members  = each.value.members
}
```

### Secret Manager reference
```hcl
data "google_secret_manager_secret_version" "db_password" {
  secret  = "projects/${var.project_id}/secrets/db-password"
  version = "latest"
}
```

## Output Format
When creating files, provide the complete file content. When modifying, show the minimal diff. Always explain the rationale for design decisions.
